    "Native shell/button/glass geometry is taken from the explicitly identified K001 family source with its recorded assembly transforms. Bottom cover, material and exact-SKU correspondence remain photo approximations.",
    "运行仅复用已实现的m5stack-basic显示、A/B/C与SD-SPI数字子集；本SKU的IP5306、扬声器、电源及传感器没有因此获得验证。",
    "官方Gray描述提到4MB Flash，但官方规格表列16MB；本条目采用16MB规格配置，冲突保留，不推断用户硬件版次。MPU6886/BMM150为硬件事实，当前复用子集不模拟两者。",
